                "metadata": {
                    "note": "Marketplace",
                    "author": "Silly Stories for Kids",
                    "category": "stories",
                    "description": "Pim Pim is no ordinary purple fuzzball—he’s the king of chaos and the master of ridiculous fun! When a mysterious glowing key turns up in his messy bedroom, Pim Pim and his best pal Teddy Winkle are whisked away on a whirlwind adventure through magical lands, grumpy green beans, golden cities, and rainbow-powered motorbikes. With every twist and turn, Pim Pim brings laughter, joy, and just the right amount of mayhem. Get ready to unlock a story packed with silliness, surprises, and heart. Are you ready?—“Ok, Let’s Go!”",
